  {
    "chunk_id": "8a09434d-2ef4-4416-b20a-383557178054",
    "content": "2. Standards de Nommage (Hostnames)\nTous les équipements doivent suivre la nomenclature suivante :",
    "chunk_type": "text",
    "page_number": 1,
    "source_file": "Test2.pdf",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "section_title": "",
    "char_count": 62,
    "original_type": "text",
    "bbox_y0": 581.8,
    "position_ratio": 0.238,
    "block_index": 8,
    "line_count": 1,
    "total_chunks": 13,
    "merged": true
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "ccff70b5-cb82-4b6f-8d56-4caeb08053eb",
    "content": "• \nLe switch principal doit être nommé : S1-CORE-SWITCH\n• \nLe routeur principal doit être nommé : R1-GW-OFFICE",
    "chunk_type": "text",
    "page_number": 1,
    "source_file": "Test2.pdf",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "section_title": "",
    "char_count": 54,
    "original_type": "text",
    "bbox_y0": 630.8,
    "position_ratio": 0.333,
    "block_index": 10,
    "line_count": 2,
    "total_chunks": 13,
    "merged": true
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "6c179407-1a3d-48d0-9eb1-d349389eb5d4",
    "content": "3. Segmentation VLAN (Switch S1)\nPour garantir la sécurité du réseau, le switch S1 doit impérativement avoir les VLANs suivants \nconfigurés :",
    "chunk_type": "text",
    "page_number": 1,
    "source_file": "Test2.pdf",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "section_title": "",
    "char_count": 108,
    "original_type": "text",
    "bbox_y0": 681.7,
    "position_ratio": 0.429,
    "block_index": 12,
    "line_count": 2,
    "total_chunks": 13,
    "merged": true
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "993c2412-ce77-4860-87b6-5acb23db93e5",
    "content": "• \nVLAN 10 : Département Ingénierie",
    "chunk_type": "text",
    "page_number": 1,
    "source_file": "Test2.pdf",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "section_title": "",
    "char_count": 35,
    "original_type": "text",
    "bbox_y0": 747.6,
    "position_ratio": 0.476,
    "block_index": 13,
    "line_count": 2,
    "total_chunks": 13
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "a18d430d-39da-4bec-929d-dae8c6dfc18a",
    "content": "• \nVLAN 20 : Département Administration\n• \nVLAN 99 : Management (Utilisé pour l'IP 192.168.56.11)",
    "chunk_type": "code_cli",
    "page_number": 2,
    "source_file": "Test2.pdf",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "section_title": "",
    "char_count": 57,
    "original_type": "text",
    "bbox_y0": 72.2,
    "position_ratio": 0.571,
    "block_index": 1,
